title: Payers › Workflow Builder › Save a draft and publish
route: /payers/summit?tab=builder
intro: Edits are held in the builder with undo and redo until 'Save draft' writes them to the store, which keeps them in this browser. Leaving with unsaved edits asks first. A published workflow is never changed in place: its first save makes a draft of the next version, and the published one keeps serving new cases until the draft is published.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Change something on the canvas or in the settings"
screen un "The bar says 'Unsaved changes.' in ochre\nbefore 'Saved in this browser · last saved ... by ...'\n'Save draft' turns green"
click c1 "Click 'Save draft', or press Ctrl+S (Cmd+S)"
decision d1 "Anything changed since the last save?"
toast t0 "'Nothing to save'\n'The draft already matches what is saved.'"
decision d2 "Is the open workflow published?"
store st1 "A draft of the next version is made beside it\nThe published version keeps matching new cases\nVersion history gets a line such as 'Added 2 steps, changed the lines between steps'\nEdit log gets an entry"
store st2 "The draft is saved in place, one snapshot per version"
toast t1 "'Draft saved'\n'Saved in this browser. It is not used for cases until it is published.'"
process p1 "Announced: 'Draft saved'\n'Unsaved changes.' goes away"
screen bn "A published workflow now shows:\n'Published version N is still in force. This draft is version M and replaces it when published.'"
decision d3 "Is browser storage blocked (private window, preview)?"
process p2 "The line reads 'Memory only: browser storage is blocked here, so changes last until the tab closes'"
click c2 "Leave: a sidebar link, another view such as Test Workflow, another workflow, 'New', 'Duplicate'\nor 'Open in Rules & Instructions'"
decision d4 "Unsaved changes?"
overlay o1 "'Leave without saving?'\n'You changed this workflow and have not saved it.'\n'Stay', 'Leave without saving', 'Save draft and leave'"
click c3 "Click 'Stay'"
click c4 "Click 'Leave without saving'"
click c5 "Click 'Save draft and leave'"
process p3 "The edits are dropped, the saved version is shown again"
process p4 "Closing or reloading the tab shows the browser's own warning while edits are unsaved"
process p5 "Reopening later restores positions and settings exactly as saved"
end e1 "The draft is saved and survives a reload"
endx e2 "Edits dropped"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Workflow Builder › Check a workflow before publishing"
goto g2 "Continues in: Payers › Workflow Builder › Publish a workflow"

s1 --> un --> c1 --> d1
d1 -->|No| t0
d1 -->|Yes| d2
d2 -->|Yes| st1 --> t1
d2 -->|No| st2 --> t1
t1 --> p1 --> d3
d3 -->|Yes| p2 --> p5
d3 -->|No| p5
st1 --> bn
p5 --> e1
un --> c2 --> d4
d4 -->|No| e1
d4 -->|Yes| o1
o1 --> c3 --> un
o1 --> c4 --> p3 --> e2
o1 --> c5 --> c1
un --> p4
e1 --> g1
e1 --> g2
